**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A decent amount of critters and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] at a high level are enough to handle this level easily, otherwise use tanky cats or meatshields to hold off the Dark Otter until it dies. [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] is recommended due to the godly attack rate for multiple critical hits, though [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Jurassic Cat Sitter]] can work just as well.

